f two negatives, which gives a positive:\n\n$$\n(-6)\\cdot (-4)=24\n$$\n\nSo we now have\n\n$$\n{{(-6)\\cdot (-4)}_{⏟}}_{24}\\cdot 2=24\\cdot 2.\n$$\n\nThen, we work out this remaining product using the fact that the product of two positives gives a positive:\n\n$$\n24\\cdot 2=48\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-f054c62e-b0dc-5a66-8acb-82dc871f9540"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-f054c62e-b0dc-5a66-8acb-82dc871f9540" :answer-field/id #uuid "f054c62e-b0dc-5a66-8acb-82dc871f9540" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-b52153ff-27d6-5b68-a81b-2318ec4e584f" :answer-field/choices ["answer-48e1cf8a-c4c1-5ebf-a916-45d3165108d4" "answer-8545a06a-880d-5689-9044-af9bc5073062" "answer-dc282516-03cd-5932-ae69-514d6b2db858" "answer-b52153ff-27d6-5b68-a81b-2318ec4e584f" "answer-2e443749-9fc2-55d4-a4b3-eb59dab7d012"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-48e1cf8a-c4c1-5ebf-a916-45d3165108d4" :answer/id #uuid "48e1cf8a-c4c1-5ebf-a916-45d3165108d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-48" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8545a06a-880d-5689-9044-af9bc5073062" :answer/id #uuid "8545a06a-880d-5689-9044-af9bc5073062" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-56" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dc282516-03cd-5932-ae69-514d6b2db858" :answer/id #uuid "dc282516-03cd-5932-ae69-514d6b2db858" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "42" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b52153ff-27d6-5b68-a81b-2318ec4e584f" :answer/id #uuid "b52153ff-27d6-5b68-a81b-2318ec4e584f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "48" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2e443749-9fc2-55d4-a4b3-eb59dab7d012" :answer/id #uuid "2e443749-9fc2-55d4-a4b3-eb59dab7d012" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "56" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-4c3a1d41-b0b4-56cb-9c22-249c40340608" :question/id #uuid "4c3a1d41-b0b4-56cb-9c22-249c40340608" :question/math-academy-id "q-180905" :question/problem "$(-\\frac{4}{7})\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We have a product of a negative number and a positive number, so the product will be negative:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-\\frac{4}{7})\\cdot (\\frac{1}{2}) & =-(\\frac{4}{7}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we multiply the fractions by multiplying the numerators and denominators separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-(\\frac{4}{7}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}) & =-(\\frac{4\\cdot 1}{7\\cdot 2}) \\\\  & =-(\\frac{2\\cdot 2\\cdot 1}{7\\cdot 2}) \\\\  & =-(\\frac{2\\cdot \\cancel{2}\\cdot 1}{7\\cdot \\cancel{2}}) \\\\  & =-(\\frac{2}{7}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{7}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-0367452d-3fb5-5cfe-b7ee-467659278ae0"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-0367452d-3fb5-5cfe-b7ee-467659278ae0" :answer-field/id #uuid "0367452d-3fb5-5cfe-b7ee-467659278ae0" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-81324ec4-a2d1-5649-b3ff-74009143c42b" :answer-field/choices ["answer-81324ec4-a2d1-5649-b3ff-74009143c42b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-81324ec4-a2d1-5649-b3ff-74009143c42b" :answer/id #uuid "81324ec4-a2d1-5649-b3ff-74009143c42b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{2}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-c193a4aa-2a3b-50a7-9351-eac6230e1fa9" :question/id #uuid "c193a4aa-2a3b-50a7-9351-eac6230e1fa9" :question/math-academy-id "q-42994" :question/problem "$(-\\frac{7}{3})\\cdot \\frac{5}{4}=$" :question/worked-solution "We have a product of a negative number and a positive number, so the product will be negative:\n\n$$\n(-\\frac{7}{3})\\cdot \\frac{5}{4}=-(\\frac{7}{3}\\cdot \\frac{5}{4})\n$$\n\nNow, we multiply the fractions by multiplying the numerators and denominators separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-(\\frac{7}{3}\\cdot \\frac{5}{4}) & =-(\\frac{7\\cdot 5}{3\\cdot 4}) \\\\  & =-(\\frac{35}{12}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{35}{12}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-1d373760-5a89-5b26-bc5e-1afb0e01c86e"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-1d373760-5a89-5b26-bc5e-1afb0e01c86e" :answer-field/id #uuid "1d373760-5a89-5b26-bc5e-1afb0e01c86e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-7b245d68-aba9-5195-8e36-cc227126fee5" :answer-field/choices ["answer-21d706c2-3988-50fc-b1c6-a770497d92fe" "answer-7b245d68-aba9-5195-8e36-cc227126fee5" "answer-5e95f5b1-b4a5-579f-998b-9d5b23bd331b" "answer-9b487510-ff34-5b5c-9fa0-b7433775f1ac" "answer-db017e05-a943-5ca7-b8b6-a2de5063e487"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-21d706c2-3988-50fc-b1c6-a770497d92fe" :answer/id #uuid "21d706c2-3988-50fc-b1c6-a770497d92fe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{28}{15}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7b245d68-aba9-5195-8e36-cc227126fee5" :answer/id #uuid "7b245d68-aba9-5195-8e36-cc227126fee5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{35}{12}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5e95f5b1-b4a5-579f-998b-9d5b23bd331b" :answer/id #uuid "5e95f5b1-b4a5-579f-998b-9d5b23bd331b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{35}{24}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9b487510-ff34-5b5c-9fa0-b7433775f1ac" :answer/id #uuid "9b487510-ff34-5b5c-9fa0-b7433775f1ac" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{35}{24}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-db017e05-a943-5ca7-b8b6-a2de5063e487" :answer/id #uuid "db017e05-a943-5ca7-b8b6-a2de5063e487" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{7}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-3cfaf2ea-e7d3-519a-880f-3892d2b32646" :question/id #uuid "3cfaf2ea-e7d3-519a-880f-3892d2b32646" :question/math-academy-id "q-43042" :question/problem "$(-\\frac{5}{3})\\cdot (-\\frac{3}{4})=$" :question/worked-solution "We have a product of two negative numbers, so the product will be positive, and we can drop the minus signs as follows:\n\n$$\n(-\\frac{5}{3})\\cdot (-\\frac{3}{4})=\\frac{5}{3}\\cdot \\frac{3}{4}\n$$\n\nNow, we multiply the fractions by multiplying the numerators and denominators separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{5}{3}\\cdot \\frac{3}{4} & =\\frac{5\\cdot 3}{3\\cdot 4} \\\\  & =\\frac{5\\cdot \\cancel{3}}{\\cancel{3}\\cdot 4} \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-1db1209a-a7a4-5bc6-ad0b-b36bc9c2e40e"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-1db1209a-a7a4-5bc6-ad0b-b36bc9c2e40e" :answer-field/id #uuid "1db1209a-a7a4-5bc6-ad0b-b36bc9c2e40e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-40cee691-844c-55f0-80f2-f3687fcfd5fe" :answer-field/choices ["answer-24e11fc4-d12c-5cf0-80e5-6daf4cf4a726" "answer-391380df-0922-5ead-949f-fcac7c10c0bc" "answer-6bbd766b-35ac-5531-abbe-97f4cd30fe7f" "answer-45643fb8-5981-57f8-a565-74c4497b7282" "answer-40cee691-844c-55f0-80f2-f3687fcfd5fe"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-24e11fc4-d12c-5cf0-80e5-6daf4cf4a726" :answer/id #uuid "24e11fc4-d12c-5cf0-80e5-6daf4cf4a726" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-391380df-0922-5ead-949f-fcac7c10c0bc" :answer/id #uuid "391380df-0922-5ead-949f-fcac7c10c0bc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6bbd766b-35ac-5531-abbe-97f4cd30fe7f" :answer/id #uuid "6bbd766b-35ac-5531-abbe-97f4cd30fe7f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-45643fb8-5981-57f8-a565-74c44